asonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lQEruqVXojYdB61nsSZ87PonAnE.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2004-02-15\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Sesame Street Presents: The Street We Live On (4057)\",\"overview\":\"At the start of SESAME STREET's 35th season, the high-spirited red muppet, Elmo, learns more about the street on which he lives. With the help of his friend Grover, Elmo is seemingly transported through time to the Sesame Street that existed before he was born. In these flashback moments, Elmo meets Mr. Hooper, the man behind the name of that famous store; witnesses Maria and Luis' wedding day and the birth of their daughter Gabi; and experiences Gordon and Susan's adoption of Miles. The finale of the episode features Sesame Street's entire cast singing a new composition called \\\"\\\"The Street We Live On.\\\"\\\" The story ends with Elmo's realization that he doesn't have to dream to find his friends on Sesame Street - all he has do to is run outside to be a part of this very happy family.\\n\\nImage courtesy of MuppetWiki and used with permission under the GNU Free Documentation License (GFDL).\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2004-02-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Best Pet in the World (4058)\",\"overview\":\"Zoe, Telly, Elmo, and Baby Bear get into a debate about who has the best pet. Each of them expresses all of the reasons that a certain pet is the best and they get very heated. The friends start to get really frustrated and angry at each other, and eventually Maria comes by to see what is going on.\\n\\nThe friends explain their problem to Maria. She helps them see that each pet is the best pet for each of them for different reasons. If each of them loves their pets, then they are all the best pets in the whole wide world.\\n\\nProblem solved!\\n\\nImage and description courtesy of MuppetWiki and used with permission under the GNU Free Documentation License (GFDL).\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"